codex
Both types are opaque in the public headers. Each has a C allocator and initializer, and callers release its single allocation with `av_free`; neither owns heap fields or has a C clone routine. I’ll use ffibox owners and borrowed handles, with typed algorithm choices so safe code cannot select an invalid digest size.
